Threat\">threat</a> generation from melee damage</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Bear.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Bear.png/420px-Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Bear.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"314\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Adamantine_Cloak_of_the_Bear.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Lined with plates of adamantine, this bearskin cloak is a formidable protection.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817033620\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.189 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3181/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22308/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6184/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n149.47%  256.907     42 Template:IO\n100.00%  171.884      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  171.884      1 -total\n 96.54%  165.943      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 50.72%   87.175      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 50.03%   86.002      2 Template:IsLamann